        },
        "authorType": "COMMENT",
        "competitionRanking": 619,
        "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/ryanholbrook\" target=\"_blank\">@ryanholbrook</a> \nIf we have any chance to get fixed train dataset, please also inspect such cases (task <strong>00d8b3db</strong>):</p>\n<pre><code>In Alice's Wonderland, a secret set of transformation rules is applied to equations. Below are a few examples:\n34/44 = 1\n41/32 = 9\n34|25 = 69\n87\\64 = 8853\nNow, determine the result for: 69/52\n</code></pre>\n<p>It assumes answer <code>17/</code> but where does the symbol <code>/</code> come from?\nAnother example (task <strong>0c8a8a16</strong>): answer <code>{17</code> contains redundant <code>{</code>.\nOne more example is reported here <a href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/nvidia-nemotron-model-reasoning-challenge/discussion/697333\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/nvidia-nemotron-model-reasoning-challenge/discussion/697333</a></p>",
        "feedbackTrackingData": {},
        "id": 3453927,
        "isThankYou": false,
        "kernelVersion": 0,
        "parent": {},
        "postDate": "2026-05-06T07:37:11.657Z",
        "rawMarkdown": "@ryanholbrook \nIf we have any chance to get fixed train dataset, please also inspect such cases (task **00d8b3db**):\n```\nIn Alice's Wonderland, a secret set of transformation rules is applied to equations. Below are a few examples:\n34/44 = 1\n41/32 = 9\n34|25 = 69\n87\\64 = 8853\nNow, determine the result for: 69/52\n```\nIt assumes answer `17/` but where does the symbol `/` come from?\nAnother example (task **0c8a8a16**): answer `{17` contains redundant `{`.\nOne more example is reported here https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/nvidia-nemotron-model-reasoning-challenge/discussion/697333",
        "replies": [
          {
