            "content": "<p>I have explained it in this discussion:\n<a href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/nvidia-nemotron-model-reasoning-challenge/discussion/686185#3432076\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/nvidia-nemotron-model-reasoning-challenge/discussion/686185#3432076</a></p>",
