            "parent": {},
            "postDate": "2026-05-07T11:33:29.663Z",
            "rawMarkdown": "I have explained it in this discussion:\nhttps://www.kaggle.com/competitions/nvidia-nemotron-model-reasoning-challenge/discussion/686185#3432076",
